/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/7/031.md:6:> - 操作类：连线/connect, 图案替换/pattern_swap, 擦除/clear, 补全/complete, 滑动/sliding, 重涂色/recolor, 层序反转/layer_order_reversal, 序列外推/sequence_extrapolation, 裁剪/crop, 筛选/filtering, 填充/fill, 计数/counting, 移动/move, 镜像/reflect, 射线延伸/ray_extend, 区域填充/flood_fill, 压缩/compress, 连通分量检测/connected_component_detection, 印章覆盖/stamp_overlay, 形状匹配/shape_matching, 透明叠加/transparent_overlay, 排序/sorting, 翻转顺序/reverse_order, 旋转/rotate, 投射/project
